            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-first-sounds\">1. First sounds</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>s(\"\u2026\")</code> picks sounds by name. Several sounds split the <strong>cycle</strong> (the loop) into\nequal steps: <code>bd</code> is a kick drum, <code>hh</code> a hi-hat, <code>sn</code> a snare.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
