            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-python-superpowers\">2. Python superpowers</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A pattern is an ordinary Python value. So anything Python can compute, you can play.\n<code>play(pattern)</code> gives you a player for any pattern.</span>\n<h3 id=\"build-patterns-with-code\">Build patterns with code</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A list comprehension makes a whole drum section: hi-hats at 1, 2, 3 and 4 hits per\ncycle, each softer and further to the right.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
